  - germline-variants
  - genomics
  - Nextflow
  - ClinVar
  - gnomAD
  - VEP
  - Streamlit
abstract: >-
  VariantPriorX is a reproducible bioinformatics portfolio project for
  evidence-based prioritization of medically relevant germline variants
  from the GIAB HG002 CMRG benchmark genome using functional consequence,
  population frequency, and curated clinical evidence.
